MODIFICATIONS IN THIS FORK
本分支的修改

This repository is a modified copy of the software licensed above.
本仓库是上述软件的修改版本。

  Upstream / 上游             https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view
  Upstream copyright / 版权   Copyright (c) 2026 Bilawal Sidhu
  Fork base / 分支基线        commit 76c20be2773018164f274f3e48a25f857ceb1dd6
                              (2026-09-15)
  Fork maintainer / 维护者    sun9bear

The original MIT notice above is retained verbatim and continues to apply to
the upstream source code. Modifications made in this fork are released under
the same MIT terms.
上述 MIT 声明原文逐字保留、未作修改，继续适用于上游源码。本分支的修改同样以
MIT 条款发布。

Summary of modifications / 修改摘要:

  - Added a runtime multilingual UI layer under public/i18n/, providing
    Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, and Korean interfaces.
    English is retained as the fallback. This layer does not alter the
    upstream English strings and touches no business logic.
  - Added i18n tooling under scripts/ (coverage scanner, Traditional Chinese
    generator, visual audit).
  - Added full-width-aware glyph advance measurement in
    src/data/detectionDraw.js.
  - Repointed four User-Agent / Referer values from the upstream repository to
    this fork, so the operators of Overpass, Nominatim, CelesTrak and the GTFS
    feeds reach the actual operator of this instance.

  The complete, per-file modification record is in FORK-NOTICE.md.
  逐文件完整修改记录见 FORK-NOTICE.md。

Non-commercial declaration / 非商业声明:

  This fork is declared NON-COMMERCIAL. This is not an added restriction — it
  is what the bundled third-party data requires, in particular:
  This fork 声明为非商业用途。这不是额外施加的限制，而是所捆绑第三方数据的要求，
  尤其是：

  - src/data/local_data/telegeography_submarine_cables/ — CC BY-NC-SA 3.0
    (NonCommercial + ShareAlike). Retained here because this fork is
    non-commercial. Commercial use requires deleting this directory or
    obtaining a commercial license from TeleGeography.
    （CC BY-NC-SA 3.0，禁止商业使用。本分支因非商业而得以保留；商用必须删除该
    目录或另行取得 TeleGeography 的商业许可。）
  - Cesium ion free tier: personal, non-commercial use only.
  - OpenSky: the upstream license itself is non-commercial.

  If you intend commercial use, delete the submarine-cable dataset above and
  re-verify every source and provider's current terms. The application still
  runs without it.
  若计划商用，请删除上述海底电缆数据集，并重新核查每个数据源与服务商的当前条款。
  删除后应用仍可正常运行。

No API credentials are included in this fork. Providers requiring keys use a
bring-your-own-key model; keys are written only to a git-ignored local .env.
本分支不附带任何 API 凭据。需要凭据的数据源采用用户自备 Key 模式，Key 仅写入
被 git 忽略的本地 .env。
